T030 (SC-002): power pulled during `rauc install`, five trials, one section per trial.
Procedure and cut points: quickstart scenario 4. Board running slot B, revision 1c7e147; the bundle
being installed is the older 40a54ec (SHA-256 1be834f0d8ebe717709b3080d5133fe25466f4629798da9bd3ea69f9f3ae70a6),
so "the previous version" is distinguishable from a half-written new one. Console capture by the user.
EXCERPT per trial: the kernel and driver messages of the reboot are omitted, nothing else is edited.

